  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Musikh&#xf6;gskolan i Stlm i samarbete med musikakademien i Sarajevo vill f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;gga &#xe5;rets sommarskola f&#xf6;r 60 musikelever fr&#xe5;n hela Balkan till Stockholm och inf&#xf6;rliva det i festivalen Spelplan Stockholm september 2002. Ungdomar fr&#xe5;n musikskolor i Norden och Baltikum deltar ocks&#xe5;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Royal Univeristy College of Music in coop with the Music academy in Sarajo arranges the second Summer School in Stockholm for 60 music students from the whole of Balkan. THe school will be part of the Stockholm Arts and Culture Festival in September 2002.</narrative>
